  "details": "Starting multiple clients (profiles) will stop remote voice from working on all clients except the last one that was started.\nEven if you close the last opened client, their voice will not transmit to the other (locally run) clients.\nAt the same time, you don't hear voice from any of your own (locally run) clients. Which makes testing voice stuff in Open Beta really tedious.\nAll this works fine on Live.\nRepo:\n- Start multiple clients (profiles) (Keep track of which one was started last)\n- Join the same instance\n- Try speak\n- No voice from any of your local clients.\n- Third Part client joins\n- Hear their voice form the last started local client.\nExcepted Behavior: Hear voice from/on the other local clients.\n\nLog files sent per email due to sensitive information",
